otes":[{"text":"The exact rulings, story extending across the folio boundary, Rashi’s identification of the two other sages, and the first Chet subentry of Gilgulei Neshamot substantiate the links. Preserve Pappi and Pappa as distinct witness readings and keep the Tzadok chronology argument in Heilprin’s voice.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 81b:7","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_81b.7"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 81b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_81b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 81b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_81b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 39b:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_39b.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 40a:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_40a.1"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 81a:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_81a.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Kiddushin 81a:3:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Kiddushin_81a.3.3"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 40a:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_40a.2"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Kiddushin 40a:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kiddushin_40a.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Moed Katan 25a:16","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Moed_Katan_25a.16"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Gilgulei Neshamot, Chet 1","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%92%D7%9C%D7%92%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%99_%D7%A0%D7%A9%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%95